24c4b822e27af6a6c6b5da68.poster.avif?t=1761367769\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106030/extras/577378d224c4b822e27af6a6c6b5da68.webm?t=1761367769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106030/extras/577378d224c4b822e27af6a6c6b5da68.mp4?t=1761367769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player character attacks automatically, while players are responsible for movement and dodging attacks (Space) and optimizing damage output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies grants experience points, and upon leveling up, players can choose to enhance weapons, skills, or companion abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each companion has unique attacks and skills that influence tactical choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The companion system is core - players can defeat Bosses (Vtubers) to recruit them as AI teammates to enter levels together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level, players enhance their own or their companions' power through leveling up to handle later enemy swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interdimensional invasion events provide various different terrain effects and modes, such as occupying specific areas within a time limit to activate magic towers, triggering terrain relics to summon monsters or Bosses from other worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interdimensional invasions will spawn at random locations at specific times during levels, adding unpredictability and testing real-time decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to continuously explore the map to discover these areas, and successfully completing invasion events will grant additional rewards or abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106030/extras/a491aaa1f485c6853f47742e2fb3e70b.poster.avif?t=1761367769\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106030/extras/a491aaa1f485c6853f47742e2fb3e70b.webm?t=1761367769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106030/extras/a491aaa1f485c6853f47742e2fb3e70b.mp4?t=1761367769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In VTuber culture, DD is a very common term that comes from the Japanese phrase &quot;\u8ab0\u3067\u3082\u5927\u597d\u304d&quot; (Daredemo Daisuki), which means &quot;love everyone.&quot; Simply put, DD is used to describe fans who like many different VTubers, rather than focusing their support on just one VTuber.</p>","developers":["\u96f6\u96f6"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3948940","name":"Isekai HKV"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106030/120f6d312d6ad2b68f29a1cbc7c43146b530eb08/header.jpg?t=1761367769","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4106030/1181513281/67bd66378b01f41255083ec933d8345fd73d3bc6/1761365376/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761367767","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4106030/1181513281/67bd66378b01f41255083ec933d8345fd73d3bc6/1761365376/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761367767","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4106030/1181513281/67bd66378b01f41255083ec933d83